            <note corresp="#d216-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d216-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 684A.86/8–2455, Top Secret;Niact;
                    Alpha. Received at 5:21 p.m.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d216-f2" n="2" xml:id="d216-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="#d215"><hi rendition="#italic">Supra.</hi></ref></p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d216-f3" n="3" xml:id="d216-f3-content">
                <p>The Department instructed Byroade and Lawson on August 25 to furnish Nasser and
                    Sharett with advance copies of the text. (Telegram 355 to Cairo sent as telegram
                    144 to Tel Aviv; Department of State, Central Files, 684A.86/8–2555)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
